{"at": "2026-10-17T15:32:22.169859+00:00", "data": {"artifacts": [], "description": "目标: http://160.202.254.160:10986/   (PHP/5.5.9-1ubuntu4.6)\n\n首页 highlight_file(__FILE__) 直接泄漏 PHP 源码:\n$zero=$_REQUEST['zero']; $first=$_REQUEST['first']; $second=$zero.$first;\nif(preg_match_all(\"/Yeedo|wants|a|girl|friend|or|a|flag/i\",$second)){\n  if(preg_match(\"/\\.\\.|flag/\",$second)) die(\"Noooood hacker!\");\n  else { $third=$first;\n    if(preg_match(\"/\\\\|\\056\\160\\150\\x70/i\",$third)){\n      $end=substr($third,5);\n      highlight_file(base64_decode($zero).$end); }}}\nelse highlight_file(__FILE__);\n\n解题要点:\n1) PHP 双引号里 \\\\ 变成一个反斜杠, 正则实际是字面量 \"|.php\" 而不是 \".php\";\n   若按 \".php\" 构造会被 die 掉或匹配不到。\n2) $end=substr($third,5) 丢弃 first 前 5 个字符, 所以 first 固定前缀 \"|.php\", 其后才是路径后缀。\n3) 第一正则要求 $second 含关键词(列表里有单个字母 a), 但 base64(\"flag.php\") 不含 a。\n   利用 PHP base64_decode 的宽容性, 在 == 填充之后追加 a: 既让正则命中, 又不改变解码结果。\n4) 第二正则只拦明文 \"..\" 和 \"flag\", base64 编码后自然绕过。\n\npayload: ?zero=<base64(path)>a&first=|.php\n  base64_decode 后得到 path, substr(first,5) 为空, 最终 highlight_file(path)。\n\nVERIFIED: /var/www/html/flag.php -> flag{2b1eb9b028236b576b9bac30bbf15f8e}", "source": ""}, "files": [{"kind": "task_context", "path": "intake/4b595a67c64445fba9cfa747db6682ee/context.json", "sha256": "d25dc71ad70dc0dd8f24bd50589ae53bf0f33149000056a8e3b5f289cf1170a6"}], "kind": "intake", "previous": "749e1d51f77b3990aaa1af123d73caae5ff64859575c14d44042849075fc870e", "seq": 2, "sha256": "b312d9909d1ad4b1b92a5cb1652fbc3f45d7f4098452ca7fd54c803aef4081d9"}
